# UAE Stocks Dashboard - Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to .env.local to configure your local live feed API key.

# Twelve Data API Key (Optional)
# Get a free API key at https://twelvedata.com to enable real-time stock price streaming.
# If omitted or left blank, the dashboard will seamlessly fall back to the built-in high-fidelity market simulator.
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=your_free_twelve_data_api_key_here
